<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ZEP" style="id">Zephaniah</book>
  <para style="h">Zephaniah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zephaniah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zephaniah</para>
  <para style="mt">Zephaniah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpi Amon’ tapa Josiah Kumpipa hun laitahin Hezekiah’ tapa Amariah, Amariah’ tapa Gedaliah, Gedaliah’ tapa Cushi, Cushi’ tapa Zephaniah kungah Topa’ kammal a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lei maitang panin na vannuoi ka phietmai ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihingte le ganhingte ka phietmai ding hi; vana leng vate le tuipi sunga ngate ka phietmai ding a, migilote ka kipaisah ding hi. Lei maitang panin mihingte ka sumaimang ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah langkhatah ka khut zahin, Jerusalem-a teng zosie langkhatah ka khut ka zah ding hi. Tam mun panin Baal a omlai zosie le milim biehna siempute’ min,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />inn khumvum tungah tuongin vantung na zosie bie-in a kunte, Topa tungah kiciem napi Milcom pasien tunga zong a kiciem mite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa zuina panin kinua hei-in Topa a sui lote, ahi sihle ama thu a dong lote, ka sumaimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa Pasien mai-ah sip khinkhian un; bang ding ahei cile Topa’ ni ang nai ta hi. Topa in biehpiehna siem zo a, ama in a zinte siensuo zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa’ biehpieh ni-in kumpi uliente, kumpi’ tapate le, gamdang puon tawh a kizem zosie dan ka tuohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin sangkil kan zosie, tatsietna le zuouthu tawh a pu pa’ innsung a kidimsah zosie, dan ka tuohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin Nga Tunkot panin kaana awging, Veng Nina panin mauna le muoltangte panin sil kisukha a ging vapuoh kiza ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mortar Venga tengte aw, kap unlen mau un. Bangzieh ahei cile sumbawlte a kisie sieng ta vua, ngun tawi a te mite zosie kisumaimang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khum hun ciengin Jerusalem, meivah tawh ka long ding a, amate in a te uh ahi ngunte tungah nuomtaha a om hit hiet mite, a lungsim sung vuah, “ Topa in na hoi sem loin, sietna zong sem lo ding hi,” a cite dan ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amau’ neisate kisutmang ding a, a innte uzong kisie gawp ding hi. Amate in innte lam nan ule a sungah a teng sih ding uhi; amate in lenggui suon nan ule a zu a dawnkha sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa’ ni thupi ni ang nai ta a, ang nai a, ang kinaw mama hi. Topa’ ni husa gin awging khu a thuoh hamsa mama a, khum munah galhangte a awng vapuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khum ni pen thangpai ni, lungkham sinkham ni, manthai ni le kisiet ni, khuo miel ni le lungzin ni, meiipite kai-in khuo a miel keikui ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />kulpi nei khuopite le a thupi gal panna munte sim nadinga pengkul kimut ni le, gal kikap kikona ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima in mite tungah tua bang lungkhamna ka tungsah ding a, amate pen mittaw lam pei tawh a kibang ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile Topa tungah a khiel zo uhi. Leivui bangin amau’ sisan kisungsuh ding a, tuale a tahsate uh pen eh tawh kibang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa’ thangpai ni ciengin, a ngun le a khamte un hunkhie zo lo ding a, a thangpaina meikuong sungah leitung bup katum ding hi; ama in leitunga teng mi zosie tungah a zauhuoi manthaina a tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A maizum thei lo minamte aw, kikhawmtuo unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ansi a kisep mang bangin ang kisemang masang, Topa’ lungthahna le Topa’ thangpaina ni, na tung vuah ang tun masangin, kikhawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama’ thupieh bang semin a kiniemkhieh gammi zosie aw, Topa sui un. Dihna sui unlen, nunnemna zong sui un; Topa’ thangpai ni ciengin ang kiphuol zo thei kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Gaza kitaisan ding a, Ashkelon hawmsuoh ding hi; suntang laipi-in Ashdod-te kidelmangin, Ekron kiphungkal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuipi gei-a a teng no Chereth-te in gimna na thuoh ding uhi! Philistia-te gam Canaan aw, Topa’ kammal in na langkhatah thu a gen hi; a teng ding koima khat zong a kinuasie lo dongin, nangma kang susie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuipi gei-a gam aw, nang pen gan cinna mun, tuucingte adingin lonona mun le tuuhuong na hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah innkuon a omlaite in tuipi gei-a om gam a tang ding vua, amate in khum munah gante cingin nitah lam ciengin Ashkelon-a a innte sung vuah amate a lum ding uhi. Azieh pen Topa a Pasien un amate ve ding a, a nei a lam teng uh a ngai bangin a kipiekia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moab-te’ zakona, Ammon-te’ mi gensietna, ka mite a zakona ule, amau’ gam sim dinga a kisah thei hamte uh ka za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin keima a nungta Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa ka hi ma bangin, Moab-te khu Sodom bang ding a, Ammon-te, Gomorrah bangin, lahkhaite le cikhuhte in a gam sung uh luo ding a, kumtawna a kinuasie mun a suoh den ta ding hi. Ka mi a omlai teng in amau’ neisate a lahpieh ding vua, ka minam a hing laite in amau’ gam a luo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vanglien Topa’ mite simmaw-in a kilietsah ziehun, amau’ kiletsahna zieha a thuoh ding uh gimna tami hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate adingin Topa pen giinhuoi mama ding hi; leitung pasien-te zosie kizieltumsah ding a, minamte’ tuipi gam le tuikul gam zosie in a mun ciet uh panin ama a bie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ethiopia-te aw, note zong ka namsau tawh ang kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale ama in leilu lam langkhatah a khut zahin, Assyria susie ding hi. Nineveh gamkhing suohsah ding a, senel gam bangin a gawta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A sungah ganhonte le gamsa vannuoi a lum ding uhi. Senel gam simbu le a hamging simbute in innkhuom dawnte giena-in a nei ding uhi. Tawlet ah simbu ham ding a, sangkilah va-ah ham ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Keima sim lo adang koi om ahei?” ama le ama kici-in, lungmuong taha a teng, lungdama a kipah khuopi hi lo amah? Bang dingin gamlah suohin, gamsate kuolna ahi ta vanuh adiei! Khum mun a zawt kha poma in ehneh ho-in khut a lelu uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi a niehsah, a kidahhuoi, mi a bawlsie khuopi in gimna a thuoh ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua khuopi in koima aw a ngai sih hi; thuhilna zong a sang sih hi. Ama in Topa muong loin, a Pasien kung a nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A sunga uliente ahile a hawh vapuoh humpite ahi vua, a thukhente ahi ule zingmawng donga bangma hen a nei lo, a zanva ngiete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kamsangte uzong ngaisutna le upna nei lote ahi uhi; a siempute in a siengtho nate buasahin, thukham tungah a tatsie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua khuopi sungah Topa a dih hi; ama in khielna kici a bawl sih hi. Zingmawng sielin a thukhen nasep sem a, phalvah sielin a sem valon hi; ahi vangin mi thuman lote in maizum zie a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in minamte ka sumang zo a, a galpanna munte uh kisie sieng zo hi; a sungah koima a pei thei lo nadingin, a khuolai lampite uh ka susie zo hi; a khuopite vuah a teng ding mi om lo a, a hawmkieu-in kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima in, “Tua khuopi in ei giing valon ding a, tua khuopi in thuhilna a mang ding hi; a tunga ka tunsah na zosie a mangngil sih ding hi,” ka ci hi. Ahi vangin a sepna zosie vuah a sie lam sep ding thalawp zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ziehin teci-a ka din ni dongin keima ei ngah in, Topa in ci hi, azieh pen amate tungah ka thangpaina le ka sinsona zosie, ka sunsuh thei nadingin, minamte kaikhawmin kumpi gamte ka khoptuo ding pen keima’ thu khensat ahi hi. Azieh pen ka lungthahna meikuong sungah leitung zosie katum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuami hun ciengin amate zosie in Topa’ min loin, lung kihuol a ama’ na a sep thei nadingun, keima in minamte’ kamham, ham siengtho tawh ka khelpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima kunga thu a ngente, a kithethang ka mite in Ethiopia gungal panin ka biehna ang puoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khumi ni ciengin nei ledona na sepna zosie ziehin kang maizumsah sih ding hi; bang ding ahei cile tua ciengin kiphatsahna nuom a sa mite, na kung panin ka hemkhie ding a, ka muol siengtho tungah na kiliensah nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile na laikimah mi nunnem le mi neilutte ka nuasie ding hi. Amate in Topa’ min tawh kibuhna a sui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel a omlai teng in khielna bawl nawn loin, zuouthu a gen nawn sih ding vua, a kam sung vuah zuouthu a gen lei a kimu nawn sih ding hi. Tua ciengin an ne-in a lum hit hiet ding vua, koima in amate a zausah nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zion tanu aw, nahpi tahin la sa in; Israel aw, awng vapo in! Jerusalem tanu aw, na lungsim neiza tawh lungdamin kipah in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in na tunga thukhennate lamang zo a, na galte a nawmang zo hi. Na laizangah Israel kumpi Topa a om hi; nang in gimna na giing nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin Jerusalem kungah tam bang kici ding hi: Zion aw, zau sin; na khut thazawsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa na Pasien, na laizangah a om hi, ama galhang pa ahi a, guolzawna ang pie ding hi; na tungah ama kipahin lungdam ding a, ama’ itna sungah nang ang siemtha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawi bawl ni bangin nahpitah lasahna tawh, nangma tungah ama a lungdam ding hi. Ama ziehin maw na puoh lo nadingin, na kung panin gimna ka ladawh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khum hun ciengin ang bawlsiete zosie dan ka pie ding hi. Khelbaite hundamin, a kipampaite ka khawm ding a, a maizumna uh phatna tawh khelpiehin, leitung muncin tengah minthang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khum huna kang khop ciengin, inn ah kang peipi ding hi; azieh pen a ngai bangin nangma muna-ah hamphatnate kang piehkia ciengin, keima in leitung mi zosie lahah na min ka thangsah ding a, mite in kang patawisah ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
</usx>
